  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Right-side scope. While this scope is active, gain: \n• 15 Range\n• 10 Zoom\n• Charge Time is set to 633ms\n\nFires a single Bolt that chains up to 5 enemies within a 10 meter radius of the original target. Applies <arc/>Arc Blind to all enemies hit for 9 seconds. The chaining bolts deal 27% reduced damage.\n\nThis scope also displays charge status and remaining magazine ammo.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-17T18:38:29.043Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
  "compendium": {
    "gid": "441434520",
    "rowKey": "The Queenbreaker\n\nWire Rifle\nMarksman OR Combat Sights\nHip-fire Grip OR Quickdraw\n↑Rewind Rounds",
    "section": "Power Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Arc Linear Fusion Rifle\nSelectable Perks, between Marksman Sights | Combat Sights, and Hip-Fire Grip | Quickdraw. \nHold [Reload] to quickly swap between Sights.\n\nWhile Marksman Sights are equipped:\nGrants +15 Range, +10 Zoom, and sets charge time to 0.633 seconds. \nRight-Side Scope displays ammo (Yellow Bar on the right) and charge level (Yellow circle on the right).\n\nShoots a single chaining bolt that deals 439 [180] Arc Damage with a 3.44x Precision Multiplier and inflicts blinds.\nHits chain up to 5 times towards the closest enemy within 10 meters, dealing 347 [?] Arc Damage and blinding. \nEnemies can only be damaged once per chain.\n\nWhile Combat Sights are equipped:\nGrants +10 Handling, +40 Aim Assist, sets charge time to 0.533 seconds and fires in 3-Round Bursts. \nLeft-Side Scope displays ability energy. Left icon is Grenade. Right Icon is Melee. Wheel is Super.\n\nShoots a 3-Bolt Burst, dealing 191 x 3 = 573 [79 x 3 = 237] Arc Damage with a 3.44x Precision Multiplier per shot\nScoring 6 Hits within ? seconds of each grants Charge Accelerant for 5.5 seconds.\n\nCharge Accelerant | 0.6x Charge Time Multiplier.\nCharge Accelerant does not decrease damage per shot. Buff can be refreshed.\n\nCatalyst:\nGrants the Rewind Rounds trait.",
